    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if your predictable life was thrown into chaos by a world of daring streamers and hidden secrets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/11c0071fd385d93e42484fd9f86ccd87.poster.avif?t=1747160654\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/11c0071fd385d93e42484fd9f86ccd87.webm?t=1747160654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/11c0071fd385d93e42484fd9f86ccd87.mp4?t=1747160654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Streaming For Love, you\u2019re a successful trader, content with routine \u2014 until a fateful encounter pulls you into the thrilling new realm of online personalities. Suddenly, your days are filled with wild surprises, eye-catching girls, and choices that ignite passions you never knew you had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But excitement comes with risks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From strange incidents at work to run-ins with cunning criminals and a deceitful manager, your calm life is about to be turned completely upside down!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of beautifully crafted CGs every chapter</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Blender animations to bring every scene to life (including the &quot;happy endings&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unique girls, each eager to get closer to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich story with a definitive ending \u2014 we always finish our games!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the hero these girls need, solving their problems and unraveling the mystery behind a ruthless tycoon \u2014 who may just be the tip of a much larger threat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/56e28106ef59ecc1ac28478e5610ced0.poster.avif?t=1747160654\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/56e28106ef59ecc1ac28478e5610ced0.webm?t=1747160654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/56e28106ef59ecc1ac28478e5610ced0.mp4?t=1747160654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the office, Chloe, Kelsey, and Charlotte need your support. On the outside world, Sophia, the cute streamer, craves your attention. May, the former fitness instructor, Melissa, the charming waitress, and many other girls all seek your guidance. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462900/extras/f42ee3c5ae197961ba5529aa6b9c55b7.avif?t=1747160654\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Love-Joint, the creators of <strong>Shale Hill Secrets</strong> and <strong>Double Homework</strong>, Streaming For Love isn\u2019t just about steamy moments and unforgettable characters \u2014 it\u2019s a thrilling saga of intrigue, danger, and desire that will keep you on the edge of your seat, eagerly awaiting each new episode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t miss out \u2014 add Streaming For Love to your <strong>wishlist now</strong> and get ready for an unforgettable 18+ adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
